132
00:06:37,199 --> 00:06:38,449
Kolossenzen 3.2.

133
00:06:38,633 --> 00:06:43,416
Richt je genegenheid op dingen boven je, niet op dingen op aarde.

134
00:06:44,199 --> 00:06:52,833
